subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Manage subscription templates

USAGE:
  subtrack [COMMANDS] <OPTIONS>

COMMANDS:
  [template] <OPTIONS>       Manage subscription templates
  add <OPTIONS>              Add a template
  delete <OPTIONS>           Delete a template
  edit <OPTIONS>             Edit a template
  list <OPTIONS>             List templates
  use <OPTIONS>              Add a subscription from a template

For more info, run any command with the `--help` flag:
  subtrack template --help
  subtrack template add --help
  subtrack template delete --help
  subtrack template edit --help
  subtrack template list --help
  subtrack template use --help

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help             Display this help message
  -v, --version          Display this version

